# Editor / OS scratch
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Migration rollback backups (`charly migrate` writes <file>.bak.<unix-ts>)
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Syncthing conflict copies — per-machine, ephemeral, resolved by hand; never versioned.
*.sync-conflict-*
bin/

# Python bytecode from this repo's own scripts/ (`pr_body_lint.py`, `squash_body.py`, …).
# Running any of them locally otherwise leaves the tree dirty, which `verify` treats as a
# failure — a self-inflicted one, with no tracked file to explain it (marketplace#412).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
